   "source": [
    "## 2.2 Analytics\n",
    "\n",
    "### No. 1 KNN (k = 5) untuk satu user acak\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Pemilihan user (reproducible):** `random.Random(SEED)` pada daftar user yang terurut, dari user yang memenuhi syarat: punya relasi `SIMILAR_TO` dan punya minimal satu item **baru** di P2 (item yang belum pernah ia sentuh di P1).\n",
    "- **Ground truth:** item yang diinteraksi user di P2 (`GT_EVENTS`) dan belum ada di P1.\n",
    "- **Rekomendasi:** ambil 5 tetangga terdekat (k = 5), jumlahkan `similarity × bobot interaksi` per item, buang item yang sudah dikenal user, urutkan.\n",
    "- Daftar peringkat dibuat sepanjang 5 (untuk Hit@5 dan NDCG@5). **3 item teratas** adalah item yang \"diiklankan\".\n",
    "- **Fallback populer:** kebanyakan user hanya punya 1-2 item, sehingga item milik tetangga sering sudah dikenal user dan kandidat KNN kurang dari 5. Kekurangannya diisi dengan item terpopuler di P1 yang belum dikenal user. Bagian dari KNN dan bagian fallback dicetak terpisah supaya transparan."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "18520f5d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "K, N = 5, 5\n",
    "GT_EVENTS = (\"view\", \"addtocart\", \"transaction\")   # ubah ke (\"addtocart\",\"transaction\") untuk ground truth yang lebih ketat\n",
    "\n",
    "p1_items = p1.groupby(\"visitorid\")[\"itemid\"].agg(lambda s: set(map(int, s)))\n",
    "p2_sel = p2[p2.event.isin(GT_EVENTS)]\n",
    "gt_all = p2_sel.groupby(\"visitorid\")[\"itemid\"].agg(lambda s: set(map(int, s)))\n",
    "\n",
    "def ground_truth(uid):\n",
    "    return gt_all.get(uid, set()) - p1_items.get(uid, set())\n",
    "\n",
    "REC_Q = \"\"\"\n",
    "MATCH (u:Visitor {visitorId: $u})-[s:SIMILAR_TO]->(n:Visitor)\n",
    "WITH u, n, s.score AS score ORDER BY score DESC LIMIT $k\n",
    "MATCH (n)-[x:INTERACTED]->(i:Item)\n",
    "WHERE NOT EXISTS { MATCH (u)-[:INTERACTED]->(i) }\n",
    "RETURN i.itemId AS itemId, sum(score * x.weight) AS skor, count(*) AS didukung_tetangga\n",
    "ORDER BY skor DESC, itemId LIMIT $n\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "NEIGH_Q = \"MATCH (u:Visitor {visitorId:$u})-[s:SIMILAR_TO]->(n:Visitor) RETURN n.visitorId AS tetangga, s.score AS similarity ORDER BY similarity DESC LIMIT $k\"\n",
    "\n",
    "POP_Q = \"\"\"\n",
    "MATCH (:Visitor:Active)-[x:INTERACTED]->(i:Item)\n",
    "RETURN i.itemId AS itemId, sum(x.weight) AS pop\n",
    "ORDER BY pop DESC LIMIT 200\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "popular = [int(r[\"itemId\"]) for r in run(POP_Q)]   # item terpopuler di P1 (untuk fallback)\n",
    "\n",
    "def recommend_knn(uid, k=K, n=N):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Rekomendasi murni dari k tetangga terdekat.\"\"\"\n",
    "    return [int(r[\"itemId\"]) for r in run(REC_Q, u=int(uid), k=k, n=n)]\n",
    "\n",
    "def recommend(uid, k=K, n=N):\n",
    "    \"\"\"KNN; jika kurang dari n item (tetangga sedikit item baru), isi dengan item populer yang belum dikenal user.\"\"\"\n",
    "    knn = recommend_knn(uid, k, n)\n",
    "    seen = p1_items.get(uid, set()) | set(knn)\n",
    "    return knn + [i for i in popular if i not in seen][: n - len(knn)]\n",
    "\n",
    "eligible = sorted(u for u in set(cands) if len(ground_truth(u)) > 0)\n",
    "print(\"User memenuhi syarat:\", len(eligible))\n",
    "\n",
    "TARGET = random.Random(SEED).choice(eligible)\n",
    "print(\"User terpilih (visitorId):\", TARGET)\n",
    "print(\"\\nTetangga (k=5):\"); display(pd.DataFrame(run(NEIGH_Q, u=TARGET, k=K)))\n",
    "recs_knn = recommend_knn(TARGET)\n",
    "recs = recommend(TARGET)\n",
    "print(\"Dari KNN      :\", recs_knn)\n",
    "print(\"Dari fallback :\", recs[len(recs_knn):])\n",
    "print(\"Top-5         :\", recs)\n",
    "print(\"3 item yang diiklankan:\", recs[:3])"
   ]
  },
