    "### No. 2 Hit@5 dan NDCG@5\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Hit@5** = 1 jika minimal satu item di 5 rekomendasi teratas ada di ground truth, selain itu 0.\n",
    "- **NDCG@5** (relevansi biner) = DCG / IDCG, dengan DCG = Σ rel_i / log2(i + 1) untuk posisi i = 1..5."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "129ef7ee",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def hit_at(recs, gt, n=5):\n",
    "    return int(any(i in gt for i in recs[:n]))\n",
    "\n",
    "def ndcg_at(recs, gt, n=5):\n",
    "    dcg = sum(1 / math.log2(pos + 2) for pos, i in enumerate(recs[:n]) if i in gt)\n",
    "    idcg = sum(1 / math.log2(pos + 2) for pos in range(min(len(gt), n)))\n",
    "    return dcg / idcg if idcg > 0 else 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "gt = ground_truth(TARGET)\n",
    "print(\"Ground truth (item baru di P2):\", len(gt), \"item\")\n",
    "print(\"Rekomendasi top-5:\", recs)\n",
    "print(\"Irisan:\", [i for i in recs if i in gt])\n",
    "print(f\"Hit@5  = {hit_at(recs, gt)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"NDCG@5 = {ndcg_at(recs, gt):.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
